{"suttaId":"thi-ap24","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[8876,8979],"vripara":"131"},"segments":{"thi-ap24:0.3":"Sakulātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap24:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","thi-ap24:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap24:2.1":"“Hitāya sabbasattānaṃ, sukhāya vadataṃ varo;","thi-ap24:2.3":"Atthāya purisājañño, paṭipanno sadevake.","thi-ap24:3.1":"“Yasaggapatto sirimā, kittivaṇṇagato jino;","thi-ap24:3.3":"Pūjito sabbalokassa, disāsabbāsu vissuto.","thi-ap24:4.1":"“Uttiṇṇavicikiccho so, vītivattakathaṃkatho;","thi-ap24:4.3":"Sampuṇṇamanasaṅkappo, patto sambodhimuttamaṃ.","thi-ap24:5.1":"“Anuppannassa maggassa, uppādetā naruttamo;","thi-ap24:5.3":"Anakkhātañca akkhāsi, asañjātañca sañjanī.","thi-ap24:6.1":"“Maggaññū ca maggavidū, maggakkhāyī narāsabho;","thi-ap24:6.3":"Maggassa kusalo satthā, sārathīnaṃ varuttamo.","thi-ap24:7.1":"“Mahākāruṇiko satthā, dhammaṃ desesi nāyako;","thi-ap24:7.3":"Nimugge kāmapaṅkamhi, samuddharati pāṇine.","thi-ap24:8.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, jātā khattiyanandanā;","thi-ap24:8.3":"Surūpā sadhanā cāpi, dayitā ca sirīmatī.","thi-ap24:9.1":"“Ānandassa mahārañño, dhītā paramasobhaṇā;","thi-ap24:9.3":"Vemātā [vemātu (sī.)] bhaginī cāpi, padumuttaranāmino.","thi-ap24:10.1":"“Rājakaññāhi sahitā, sabbābharaṇabhūsitā;","thi-ap24:10.3":"Upāgamma mahāvīraṃ, assosiṃ dhammadesanaṃ.","thi-ap24:11.1":"“Tadā hi so lokagaru, bhikkhuniṃ dibbacakkhukaṃ;","thi-ap24:11.3":"Kittayaṃ parisāmajjhe [catuparisāya majjhe (syā.)], aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapesi taṃ.","thi-ap24:12.1":"“Suṇitvā tamahaṃ haṭṭhā, dānaṃ datvāna satthuno;","thi-ap24:12.3":"Pūjitvāna ca sambuddhaṃ, dibbacakkhuṃ apatthayiṃ.","thi-ap24:13.1":"“Tato avoca maṃ satthā,‘nande lacchasi patthitaṃ;","thi-ap24:13.3":"Padīpadhammadānānaṃ, phalametaṃ sunicchitaṃ.","thi-ap24:14.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap24:14.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap24:15.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap24:15.3":"Sakulā nāma nāmena [sakulāti ca nāmena (syā.)], hessati satthu sāvikā’.","thi-ap24:16.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap24:16.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap24:17.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap24:17.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap24:18.1":"“Paribbājakinī āsiṃ, tadāhaṃ ekacārinī;","thi-ap24:18.3":"Bhikkhāya vicaritvāna, alabhiṃ telamattakaṃ.","thi-ap24:19.1":"“Tena dīpaṃ padīpetvā, upaṭṭhiṃ sabbasaṃvariṃ;","thi-ap24:19.3":"Cetiyaṃ dvipadaggassa [dipadaggassa (sī. syā. pī.)], vippasannena cetasā.","thi-ap24:20.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap24:20.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap24:21.1":"“Yattha yatthūpapajjāmi, tassa kammassa vāhasā;","thi-ap24:21.3":"Pajjalanti [sañjalanti (syā. ka.), saṃcaranti (pī.)] mahādīpā, tattha tattha gatāya me.","thi-ap24:22.1":"“Tirokuṭṭaṃ tiroselaṃ, samatiggayha pabbataṃ;","thi-ap24:22.3":"Passāmahaṃ yadicchāmi, dīpadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap24:23.1":"“Visuddhanayanā homi, yasasā ca jalāmahaṃ;","thi-ap24:23.3":"Saddhāpaññāvatī ceva, dīpadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap24:24.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, jātā vippakule ahaṃ;","thi-ap24:24.3":"Pahūtadhanadhaññamhi, mudite rājapūjite.","thi-ap24:25.1":"“Ahaṃ sabbaṅgasampannā, sabbābharaṇabhūsitā;","thi-ap24:25.3":"Purappavese sugataṃ, vātapāne ṭhitā ahaṃ.","thi-ap24:26.1":"“Disvā jalantaṃ yasasā, devamanussasakkataṃ;","thi-ap24:26.3":"Anubyañjanasampannaṃ, lakkhaṇehi vibhūsitaṃ.","thi-ap24:27.1":"“Udaggacittā sumanā, pabbajjaṃ samarocayiṃ;","thi-ap24:27.3":"Na cireneva kālena, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap24:28.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap24:28.3":"Paracittāni jānāmi, satthusāsanakārikā.","thi-ap24:29.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap24:29.3":"Khepetvā āsave sabbe, visuddhāsiṃ sunimmalā.","thi-ap24:30.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thi-ap24:30.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thi-ap24:31.1":"“Yassatthāya pabbajitā, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap24:31.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thi-ap24:32.1":"“Tato mahākāruṇiko, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ;","thi-ap24:32.3":"Dibbacakkhukānaṃ aggā, sakulāti naruttamo.","thi-ap24:33.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap24:34.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap24:35.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap24:36.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ sakulā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap24:37.1":"Sakulātheriyāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
